This project is a native macOS reimplementation of Gesture Synth by Eric Wei
(https://github.com/ericwei97-cloud/gesture-synth). No source code from the
original project is included here; it's a from-scratch rewrite in Swift using
Apple's Vision and AVAudioEngine frameworks. The gesture-to-chord design and
overall interaction model are adapted from that project, under its own
license terms:

